Vendored third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This distribution embeds the codeindex engine verbatim. It is copied — not
installed — into src/vendor/, and the build inlines it into the shipped bundle
(scripts/ultraindex.mjs and its mirror under skills/ultraindex/scripts/), so the
engine's bytes travel inside every artifact this project ships.

  Component: codeindex (the deterministic repo-indexing engine)
  Homepage:  https://github.com/maxgfr/codeindex
  License:   MIT
  Copyright: (c) 2026 maxgfr
  Files:     src/vendor/codeindex-engine.mjs
             src/vendor/codeindex-engine.d.mts

The exact upstream revision is pinned, with sha256 digests of both files, in
src/vendor/engine.meta.json. scripts/sync-engine.mjs --check re-hashes the
vendored bytes against that pin offline; the daily engine-repin workflow moves
the pin forward only when every gate of this repo stays green.

Nothing in src/vendor/ is authored here. Report engine defects upstream.
